==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A feeling of [[I never eat before going to the airport because if I do I'll puke.]], [[I don't want to get dizzy on the way to the airport and throw up.]] etc. caused by the motion of an [[aircraft]]; a form of [[motion sickness]].

